    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pet Cam&quot;</strong> is a small horror story game where the player takes on the role of a female protagonist named Arya. Over time, the girl's shocking past unfolds before her eyes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.poster.avif?t=1748621021\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.webm?t=1748621021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.mp4?t=1748621021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within a gameplay time of\u00a0<strong>25-30 minutes</strong>, the game offers <strong>multiple endings</strong> for players to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a <strong>first-person walking simulator</strong>, focusing on everyday tasks and exploration in both Arya\u2019s house and a mysterious location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Daily Life Simulation</strong>: Help Arya navigate her day-to-day routine, from getting ready for work to completing small tasks in her home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unnerving Atmosphere</strong>: Explore Arya\u2019s home and areas where the atmosphere becomes increasingly unsettling with every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-Based Narrative</strong>: Dive deep into a story driven by environmental clues and interactions as you unravel the mystery behind the horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Mechanics</strong>: A slow-burn, immersive experience that rewards players for taking their time to explore and pay attention to details.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pet Cam&quot;</strong> is a small horror story game where the player takes on the role of a female protagonist named Arya. Over time, the girl's shocking past unfolds before her eyes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.poster.avif?t=1748621021\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.webm?t=1748621021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227260/extras/c21bd11725f9bdb38404513f016c7993.mp4?t=1748621021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within a gameplay time of\u00a0<strong>25-30 minutes</strong>, the game offers <strong>multiple endings</strong> for players to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a <strong>first-person walking simulator</strong>, focusing on everyday tasks and exploration in both Arya\u2019s house and a mysterious location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Daily Life Simulation</strong>: Help Arya navigate her day-to-day routine, from getting ready for work to completing small tasks in her home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unnerving Atmosphere</strong>: Explore Arya\u2019s home and areas where the atmosphere becomes increasingly unsettling with every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-Based Narrative</strong>: Dive deep into a story driven by environmental clues and interactions as you unravel the mystery behind the horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator Mechanics</strong>: A slow-burn, immersive experience that rewards players for taking their time to explore and pay attention to details.</p></li></ul>",
